Hello! My name is **Cody Dailey**!


::: {.cell layout-align="center"}

:::

<br>

<center>
<figure>
    <img src="/files/pictures/CAD_photo.png" height="350px" width=auto>
    <figcaption>Sitting at a café in Montpellier, France 2020</figcaption>
</figure>
